course: dictionary
lesson: 8
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. The word ABC can mean the alphabet, the basic facts of something, or the name of a TV and radio company. To know which meaning is right, read the words around it: they are its context.
explain: «Jack's friend says writing was invented in one place and everyone copied the ABC.» Writing is made of letters, so ABC here means the alphabet, the letters from A to Z.
explain: «Picture the ABC check on the drive, Air, Brakes, Chain, then Bikeability training before you ride on the road.» Here ABC is a short list of basic checks for your bike, because the words Air, Brakes and Chain tell you what is being checked. Always try your meaning in the sentence to see if it fits.
fact: ABC means the alphabet, the letters A to Z. You can say the ABC or the ABCs, and both mean the same thing.
fact: «The ABC of cooking» means the simplest, basic facts about cooking.
fact: «Easy as ABC» means very easy.
fact: ABC is also a short form (an abbreviation) of the Australian Broadcasting Corporation and the American Broadcasting Company, which are big TV and radio companies.
fact: Phrases to learn: «learn your ABCs», «as easy as ABC», «ABC book».
exercise: «In early lessons, children learn their ABCs and sing the alphabet song.» What does ABCs mean here? | A very easy game | The names of two TV companies | A bike safety check | *The alphabet, the letters A to Z
exercise: «Picture the ABC check on the drive, Air, Brakes, Chain.» What is the ABC check? | The name of a radio station in London | *A short list of basic checks for your bike | A song the children sing in class | A kind of bike race
exercise: «Mia said the maths test was as easy as ABC.» What does «as easy as ABC» mean? | Not finished yet | *Very easy | Written in a book | Hard to read
test: In «Australia, the ABC usually means the national TV and radio», what does ABC stand for? | American Book Company | Australian Bike Club | *Australian Broadcasting Corporation | Alphabet Book Collection
test: «Learning the ABC of football means learning its basics.» What does ABC mean in this sentence? | A TV company | Only the letters A, B and C | *The basic facts | A kind of song
exam: Ruby reads «The ABC of the rules is easy to learn» and is not sure what ABC means. What is the best way to find its meaning? | Ask someone to read it for you | Skip the sentence and forget it | Pick the first meaning you remember and never check it | *Read the words around it and try each meaning in the sentence
